#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:5
msgid "How to Avoid ATM Traps – HSBC HK"
msgstr "自動櫃員機有甚麼陷阱？ - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:12
msgid "How to Avoid ATM Traps"
msgstr "自動櫃員機有甚麼陷阱？"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:14
msgid "Cyber security &amp; fraud hub"
msgstr "網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:19
msgid ""
"Most of us use ATMs on a regular basis. But just because you’re familiar "
"with the machines doesn’t mean you should let your guard down. Take a "
"look at some of the ways criminals have used them to steal people’s "
"personal banking details."
msgstr "大部分人都經常使用自動櫃員機，但即使熟悉操作，亦不代表應放低戒備。不法分子會以各種方式盜取個人戶口資料，以下略舉數例。"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:22
msgid "ATM skimming"
msgstr "藉自動櫃員機盜取資料"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:23
msgid ""
"Criminals have been known to attach card readers to the card slots on an "
"ATM. When an unsuspecting customer inserts their card into the ATM, the "
"card reader will copy all the account information associated with that "
"card. Other fraudsters will hide pinhole cameras near an ATM and then "
"loosen or remove the PIN shields so they can record you entering your "
"PIN."
msgstr ""
"某些匪徒會在自動櫃員機的卡槽裝上讀卡器。如客戶並無防備而把卡插入櫃員機，讀卡器便會複製與該卡相關的所有戶口資料。其他匪徒則會在櫃員機附近暗藏針孔攝錄機，遮蓋密碼鍵盤的保護罩也會遭人拆鬆或移除，"
" 以便針孔攝錄機可偷錄客人輸入的私人密碼。"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:24
msgid "Other ATM frauds"
msgstr "針對自動櫃員機的其他行騙方式"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:25
msgid ""
"It’s not always so high tech. Sometimes a criminal will just watch you "
"closely to try and see your PIN as you enter it. Afterwards they might "
"try to distract you, perhaps by telling you that you dropped money or "
"personal belongings. When you look away, they could try to swap your ATM "
"or credit card for a dummy card."
msgstr "匪徒絕非全靠高科技作案，有時只會緊盯着受害者，試圖在您輸入時窺探其私人密碼。之後，他們可能會說您的錢或財物丟在地上，從而分散您的注意力。若您在此時轉移目光，匪徒便會伺機以假卡換走您的櫃員機卡或信用卡。"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:28
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "防範措施"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:30
msgid ""
"If you notice any device or behaviour that looks suspicious, cancel your "
"transaction immediately, take back your card and inform us"
msgstr "若發現有任何可疑裝置或遇有懷疑時，請即取消交易，把卡取回並即時通知本行"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:31
msgid "Don’t allow yourself to be distracted when you use the ATM"
msgstr "使用自動櫃員機時要保持警覺，不要讓其他人分散您的注意力"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:32
msgid ""
"Refuse all offers of help from strangers when you are performing ATM "
"transactions"
msgstr "在進行自動櫃員機交易時，於任何情況下切勿接受陌生人的協助"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:33
msgid ""
"Cover the numeric pad and make sure no one is looking over your shoulder "
"when you enter your PIN"
msgstr "輸入私人密碼時，請把鍵盤遮蔽，並確保無人從您背後偷看"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:34
msgid ""
"Never disclose your personal security details such as account number or "
"PIN to anyone, even if they claim to be from the bank or the police"
msgstr "切勿透露戸口號碼或私人密碼予他人，即使對方自稱是本行職員或警察"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:35
msgid "Memorise your PIN and don’t write it down"
msgstr "請緊記你的私人密碼而不要寫下它"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:36
msgid "Choose a PIN that’s hard to guess"
msgstr "在選取密碼時，使用難於被人猜度的密碼"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:37
msgid ""
"Use different PINs for different websites and channels (ATM, Phone "
"Banking, Internet Banking)"
msgstr "在使用不同的銀行服務（例如自動櫃員機，電話理財和網上理財）時，選用不同的密碼"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:38
msgid ""
"Do not use your identity card number, birthday, telephone number or "
"commonly used sequences such as 888888, 123456 or 00 as your PIN"
msgstr "切勿選用身份證號碼、生日日期、電話號碼或常用的數字組合（例如：888888、123456或00）作私人密碼"

#: frontend/templates/atm-scams.html:39
msgid "Change your PIN regularly"
msgstr "定期更改私人密碼"

